"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"There is no complete eligible award journey in this result set. The United lead is a reasonable first check because it reports the highest seat count shown, but that count is not a booking guarantee. All three award records are date-only, so none confirms a timed itinerary or connection. Their point and fee quote scopes are unknown; point totals from different programs are not directly comparable.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A2@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"United date-only lead\",\"v\":\"It reports 9 seats and 60,500 United miles, with fees reported as 2,820 USD minor units. That may make it useful to verify first; the downside is that it gives no flight times or complete itinerary, and the quote scope is unknown.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A3@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"Alaska date-only lead\",\"v\":\"This reports 8 seats and 42,500 Alaska miles, with fees reported as 5,090 USD minor units. It is another lead to check, but the date-only record confirms neither timing nor routing details; its mileage figure is not directly comparable with another program’s.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A1@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"Aeroplan date-only lead\",\"v\":\"It reports 2 seats and 65,000 Aeroplan points, with fees reported as 11,650 CAD minor units. Check it if Aeroplan is relevant to you, but it has the same date-only itinerary gap, and its points are not directly comparable with other programs’.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-01T22:55-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash benchmark\",\"v\":\"The selected cash itinerary is a useful baseline: it is timed, goes via HKG with one stop, and returned a USD 640 quote. Its price scope is unknown, so it is not a per-person or all-in comparison with the award leads.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Next, ask the award programs to confirm a complete itinerary, current availability, exact fees and their quote scope. The search provider reports partial coverage, including omitted SFO–BKK detail, and cautions that results may not be real-time; confirm directly with the booking provider before deciding.\"}]}"
